msgstr "Soutiens"

msgid "Community influence and belonging"
msgstr "Influence communautaire et sentiment d appartenance"

msgid ""
"Non-students who join ASCAI strengthen the network while gaining practical "
"association resources, event visibility, governance participation, and a "
"clear place in the Cameroonian community in Lazio."
msgstr ""
"Les non etudiants qui rejoignent ASCAI renforcent le reseau tout en accedant"
" a des ressources pratiques de l association, a la visibilite des "
"evenements, a la participation a la gouvernance et a une place claire dans "
"la communaute camerounaise du Latium."

msgid "For students"
msgstr "Pour les etudiants"

msgid "Arrival and campus starter vault"
msgstr "Base de depart pour l arrivee et le campus"

msgid ""
"Enrollment checklists, university admin templates, scholarship calendars, "
"housing tips, and forms that reduce mistakes during the first year in Italy."
msgstr ""
"Checklists d inscription, modeles administratifs universitaires, calendriers"
" de bourses, conseils logement et formulaires qui reduisent les erreurs "
"pendant la premiere annee en Italie."

msgid "For graduates and workers"
msgstr "Pour les diplomes et travailleurs"

msgid "Career and professional growth kit"
msgstr "Kit de croissance professionnelle et de carriere"

msgid ""
"Practical guides for job applications, Italian-style CVs, internships, "
"qualification recognition, and networking opportunities inside the "
"association."
msgstr ""
"Guides pratiques pour les candidatures, les CV au format italien, les "
"stages, la reconnaissance des qualifications et les opportunites de "
"reseautage au sein de l association."

msgid "For families and supporters"
msgstr "Pour les familles et les soutiens"

msgid "Community support and participation desk"
msgstr "Espace de soutien et de participation communautaire"

msgid ""
"Association documents, trusted orientation resources, event access, and "
"community pathways for people who want to contribute beyond student life."
msgstr ""
"Documents de l association, ressources d orientation fiables, acces aux "
"evenements et parcours communautaires pour les personnes qui veulent "
"contribuer au dela de la vie etudiante."

